  data: {
    LLM: 'Hold the trump Under (Puur); bid a shorter suit with the Under than a long suit without it. Lead to give partner information.\n\nOpening 40/60/80/100 of a suit can guarantee the Under; partner raises with confidence. Compete in Undenufe when opponents have high cards. Sacrifice bids when opponents are likely to make their contract.\n\nCross-ruff to establish long suits; discard shows suit you do not want led. Towards game end, double or outbid when opponents would otherwise reach 2000.',
